// FIXTURE — must be caught by PINE049
// TradingView says: Cannot use 'strategy.entry' in local scope.
// Order calls must be at global scope; return the decision instead.
//
// This file is DELIBERATELY broken. It is never scaffolded, published or
// linted by CI — tests/test_compile_error_corpus.py asserts PINE049 still
// fires on it, so the incident can never silently regress.
//@version=6
strategy("Fixture", overlay=true,
     default_qty_type=strategy.percent_of_equity, default_qty_value=10,
     initial_capital=10000, commission_type=strategy.commission.percent,
     commission_value=0.05, slippage=1)

tryEnter(bool go) =>
    if go
        strategy.entry("Long", strategy.long)
    0

plot(close, title="Close")
